{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Chore Miner》把日常家務化成孩子願意完成的任務，適合想培養責任感、以真實獎勵建立家庭習慣的家長與子女。應用程式支援 iPhone 與 iPad，原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-217.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>家務任務與真實獎勵</h2>\n<p>家長可自訂家務、寶石值與真實獎勵，子女完成後由家長審核，再賺取寶石、建立連續紀錄，並探索 100 個插畫礦區。應用提供每日、每週或一次性任務，亦可要求重試或加碼獎勵；家庭裝置以附近同步分享進度，毋須電郵註冊或雲端帳戶，亦無廣告、追蹤或分析。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-252-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-253-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-254-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-255-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-256-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-257-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Chore Miner</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/chore-miner/id6821229722?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T22:24:22.745227+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T22:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:37:32.266249+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T22:17:49.847276+00:00","content_hash":"cd05859bde631dde32330bf687a1b36a8da90f4aa92797af82526de568a09a17","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}